    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : owns
    Owner "1" *-- "0..*" TimeWindow : available during
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : has
    Pet "0..*" --> "0..1" Owner : owned by
    Task "0..*" --> "0..1" Pet : belongs to
    Task "0..1" --> "0..1" Task : next occurrence
    Task ..> Pet : mark_complete adds successor
    DailyPlan --> Owner : planned for
    DailyPlan o-- "0..*" Task : scheduled / skipped
    DailyPlan ..> Task : complete_task calls mark_complete
    Scheduler --> Owner : uses
    Scheduler --> "0..1" DailyPlan : holds latest
    Scheduler ..> DailyPlan : creates
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts / filters / schedules
    Scheduler ..> TimeWindow : places tasks in
    Scheduler ..> DependencyCycleError : raises
    Scheduler ..> MustDoError : raises
    Task "0..*" ..> "0..*" Task : depends on (by title)
    Scheduler ..> helpers : uses time conversion and conflict message
